{
  "id": "MAL.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "MAL",
  "reference": "Malachi 2",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAL 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And now, O priests, this command is for you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you will not listen, if you will not lay it to heart to give glory to my name, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts, then I will send the curse upon you and I will curse your blessings; indeed I have already cursed them, because you do not lay it to heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I will rebuke your offspring, and spread dung upon your faces, the dung of your offerings, and I will put you out of my presence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn Compare Gk Syr: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "and he shall bear you to it",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So shall you know that I have sent this command to you, that my covenant with Levi may hold, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My covenant with him was a covenant of life and peace, and I gave them to him, that he might fear; and he feared me, he stood in awe of my name. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "True instruction",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "law",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " was in his mouth, and no wrong was found on his lips. He walked with me in peace and uprightness, and he turned many from iniquity. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the lips of a priest should guard knowledge, and men should seek instruction",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "law",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " from his mouth, for he is the messenger of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But you have turned aside from the way; you have caused many to stumble by your instruction;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "law",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " you have corrupted the covenant of Levi, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and so I make you despised and abased before all the people, inasmuch as you have not kept my ways but have shown partiality in your instruction.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "law",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have we not all one father? Has not one God created us? Why then are we faithless to one another, profaning the covenant of our fathers? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judah has been faithless, and abomination has been committed in Israel and in Jerusalem; for Judah has profaned the sanctuary of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", which he loves, and has married the daughter of a foreign god. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "May the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " cut off from the tents of Jacob, for the man who does this, any to witness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn Compare Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "arouse",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " or answer, or to bring an offering to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this again you do. You cover the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s altar with tears, with weeping and groaning because he no longer regards the offering or accepts it with favor at your hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You ask, “Why does he not?” Because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was witness to the covenant between you and the wife of your youth, to whom you have been faithless, though she is your companion and your wife by covenant. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Has not the one God made",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "has he not made one?",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and sustained for us the spirit of life?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "and a remnant of spirit was his",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And what does he desire? Godly offspring. So take heed to yourselves, and let none be faithless to the wife of his youth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“For I hate",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "he hates",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " divorce, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the God of Israel, and covering one's garment with violence, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts. So take heed to yourselves and do not be faithless.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have wearied the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with your words. Yet you say, “How have we wearied him?” By saying, “Every one who does evil is good in the sight of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he delights in them.” Or by asking, “Where is the God of justice?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
